# Accepted risks. Every entry needs a reason, an owner and a review date.
#
# KSV047 - "Do not allow privilege escalation from node proxy"
#   Prometheus scrapes cAdvisor and kubelet volume stats through the API server
#   proxy (nodes/proxy), which is how per-container CPU/memory and PVC usage
#   are collected. The permission is read-only (get), bound only to the
#   prometheus ServiceAccount in the monitoring namespace.
#   Owner: platform. Review by: 2027-01-31 (alternative: scrape kubelet :10250
#   directly with a dedicated client certificate).
AVD-KSV-0047
